:name: Pixhawk 6X FMU boot
:description: Boots the OE-built px4-firmware ELF against Renode's STM32H743 CPU model, per specs/003-renode-boot.md.

using sysbus
$name?="pixhawk6x"
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription $repl

showAnalyzer usart3

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset
